This product is a modified version of agent-desktop by Vercel Labs,
https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The original copyright notices are retained.

Changes in this fork include a strict headless default for Windows with a
per-command focus guard, a fail-closed exclusion fence with screenshot
redaction, Dark Room handle-based secret filling, a screen-edge activity
glow, a local notes folder (the jetpack), and a per-user Windows installer.
The command line program is renamed otherhand.
